docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r6-delta.log:719:docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:3091:  9030	[高] [GRILL.md:11](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/GRILL.md:11) 证据：`{stage,reason,errorName}` 不足以区分真实拒付点。同一个 `RUN_COMPLETION_INVALID` 在 source completion 内至少覆盖 issuer 抛错、result 形状、artifact、rawReplay、proof、observation 等分支（[replay-completion.mjs:102](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:102) 至 [同文件:137](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:137)），distilled 又有另一组同码分支（[同文件:251](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:251) 至 [同文件:266](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/dual-replay/replay-completion.mjs:266)）。更关键的是 raw observer 的 `begin/finish` await 没有 catch（[raw-replay-runner.mjs:286](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-replay-runner.mjs:286)、[同文件:329](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-replay-runner.mjs:329)），抛错会最终只留下泛化 `Error/TypeError`，不会产生可定位的逐事件记录。修法：增加闭合枚举 `refusalPoint`/`phase`，至少区分 issuer throw、result shape、artifact shape、raw status、proof、observation、observer begin/finish、formal replay 和 prepared-runtime 各分支；仅补充结构化枚举/计数，仍禁止 message。A4 必须证明每个同码生产点都能唯一归因。
docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r6-delta.log:720:docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:3095:  9034	[高] [GRILL.md:9](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/GRILL.md:9) 证据：固定 `cycle-evidence.json` 缺少 capture 身份绑定，而 capture 路径会复用（[record-capture.mjs:105](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/record-capture.mjs:105)）。本次凭据门拒写或写盘失败时，上一次边车仍可能留在原位，被误认为本次真因；计划也未规定原子写、部分文件清理及退出码语义。修法：顶层白名单补 `schemaVersion`、`artifactKind`、`captureSha256`，采用 digest 命名或强制读取时与当前 capture exact bytes 验签；复用现役“整文过闸后原子写”的模式（[raw-proof-output.mjs:51](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-proof-output.mjs:51)）。明确 `EVIDENCE_SCHEMA_REJECTED`、`EVIDENCE_CREDENTIAL_REJECTED`、`EVIDENCE_WRITE_FAILED`：闭环返回保持原样，但请求取证而未产出合格边车时 CLI 必须非零，且不留旧档冒充、临时文件或半份文件。
docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r6-delta.log:721:docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:3097:  9036	[高] [GRILL.md:27](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/GRILL.md:27) 证据：E1–E6 尚未钉住上述风险。E1 未定义“未知键拒”是毒化整批还是静默丢事件；E2 只写一个 issuer throw，未覆盖 source/resolved/distilled；E3 未覆盖 observer begin/finish 与 formal/prepared 拒付；E5 在 [plan.md:20](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan.md:20) 被弱化为返回对象深等，未证明输出字节、调用次数、ratchet、关闭次数、控制台及缺省不落边车；E6 未约束异步 sink 或每个发射点；[plan.md:27](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan.md:27) 的 A1–A3 也未定义。修法：采用 append-or-poison collector；为所有拒付点建立枚举矩阵；E5 比较返回值、产物字节、调用/关闭次数及无边车副作用；E6 遍历每个发射点，并将 sink 明确定义为同步接口；补齐 A1–A3 的输入、预期退出码及产物断言。
docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r6-delta.log:722:docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:3099:  9038	[中] [plan.md:6](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan.md:6) 证据：§1 的四文件清单与真实链路不符。真实入口是 `casey.mjs` → 薄别名 [teachin-cycle.mjs:14](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/bin/teachin-cycle.mjs:14) → [record.mjs:411](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/bin/record.mjs:411) → cycle entry → [dual-replay-orchestrator-core.mjs:212](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/dual-replay-orchestrator-core.mjs:212) → runtime adapter → [raw-event-observation.mjs:388](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-event-observation.mjs:388) → raw runner；formal/prepared 的同码拒付还位于 [raw-axes-adapter.mjs:386](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/raw-axes-adapter.mjs:386) 与 [prepared-runtime-seam.mjs:110](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/lib/teachin/prepared-runtime-seam.mjs:110)。邻接测试也漏了 completion、resolved-completion、prepared-run 和冻结精确接口的 [production-boundary golden:231](/mnt/d/ctx/heren/casey/tests/_golden/teachin-replayability-equivalence-production-boundary.static.golden.mjs:231)。修法：§1 按上述真实链路逐文件列出“改/不改及原因”，并把这些直接邻接 golden 全部纳入 s2；否则无法证明入口名、拒付点和形状没有漂移。
