docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/plan-codex-r2-delta.log:15:delta 复审（teachin-cycle-evidence，read-only，重读 docs/plans/teachin-cycle-evidence/ 两文档 v2）。你 r1 判 5H+1M。处置：H1→AsyncLocalStorage 观测上下文+safeEmit 侧通道、零 authority/键集/返回值改动、production-boundary 静态钉入 s2；H2→refusalPoint 闭合枚举逐生产点一员（source 六分支/distilled/observer begin·finish/formal/prepared）、A4 完成语义=唯一归因；H3→字符串全出固定枚举、异常名内建白名单降格 OtherError、Reflect.get 防 getter、四层闸末门 credentialGate、E4 五类反例；H4→captureSha256 绑定+artifactKind+原子写+EVIDENCE_* 三码+CLI 非零+旧档不冒充（E7）；H5→E1-E7 重构（毒化语义、发射点矩阵、E5 字节全等+调用次数+控制台、E6 逐点、A1-A4 定义）；M6→§1 按真实链路逐文件改/不改清单+邻接金牌补齐（completion/resolved-completion/prepared-run/production-boundary）。复核六条处置与新洞。输出：第一行 PLAN_APPROVE 或 PLAN_CHANGES_REQUIRED；各条 FIXED/NOT_FIXED+证据；新问题按级；末行 REVIEW_DONE_SENTINEL
